page('how-it-works.html','How it works','''<main id="main" class="inner-main"><div class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">THE EXPERIENCE</p><h1>A little more you.<br><span class="muted">A lot more connection.</span></h1></div><section class="experience"><div class="experience-copy"><div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Explore your AI"><button id="tab-chat" role="tab" aria-controls="feature-panel" aria-selected="true" data-feature="chat">01&nbsp; Chat</button><button id="tab-remember" role="tab" aria-controls="feature-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-feature="remember">02&nbsp; Remember</button><button id="tab-earn" role="tab" aria-controls="feature-panel" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-feature="earn">03&nbsp; Earn</button></div><div id="feature-panel" class="feature-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-chat" tabindex="0"><h2 id="feature-title">Built around<br>how you speak.</h2><p id="feature-body">Your AI is shaped around your personality and conversational style. It can chat with fans on Telegram while you’re offline.</p><p class="small-note">Fans are told they’re chatting with your AI.</p></div><a class="button" href="earnings.html">Explore your earning potential</a></div><div class="phone-stage"><div class="phone" aria-label="Illustrative Telegram conversation"><div class="phone-camera" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="phone-status" aria-hidden="true"><span>9:41</span><span>●●● &nbsp; ▰</span></div><div class="chat-header"><img src="creator-phone.webp" width="44" height="44" alt=""><div><strong>Sophie AI</strong><span>AI companion · Telegram</span></div><span class="chat-menu" aria-hidden="true">···</span></div><div class="chat-messages" id="chat-messages" aria-live="polite"><p class="chat-date">TODAY</p><div class="bubble outgoing">Finally finished that workout 😅<time>10:24</time></div><div class="bubble incoming">Okay, I see you! Was it the leg session you were putting off?</div><div class="bubble outgoing">You remembered 😂<time>10:25</time></div><div class="bubble incoming">Of course. So… stairs tomorrow might be interesting.</div></div><div class="chat-compose" aria-hidden="true"><span>Message</span><span>＋</span></div></div><p class="demo-label">Example conversation · fictional creator</p></div></section><section class="responsibilities"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR PART</p><p>Your personality. Your selected content.<br>Your audience to introduce it to.</p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">OUR PART</p><p>Setup, technical operation and support.<br>A place to follow your performance.</p></div></section><section class="faq"><h2>A few things to know.</h2><div><details><summary>Do I need to be online all the time?</summary><p>Your AI can keep conversations going when you’re offline. You still help shape its personality, choose content and introduce it to your audience.</p></details><details><summary>How does it earn?</summary><p>The experience supports paid messages, selected content and tips. Your earnings depend on fan activity, fees and the revenue share agreed with Moxy.</p></details><details><summary>Will fans know it’s AI?</summary><p>Yes. The experience is presented as your AI, so fans understand who they’re interacting with.</p></details><details><summary>What happens before launch?</summary><p>You complete your creator profile and supply the content you want to use. Moxy walks you through the setup, commercial terms and launch process.</p></details></div></section></main>''')
